            "review_title": "Review at Ashima Mushroom Hotpot - Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Ryan Hubris #1 in Vietnam\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1144 contributions\n3\nAmazing mushrooms hotpot and more\nJul 2018 • Friends\nFood: 23 types of mushrooms for you to choose from. The broth is incredibly tasty. You can choose a hotpot to share to individual a la carte dishes ranging from noodles to grilled meats.\nServices: Excellent\nPrice: Moderate\nValue: Great value for the money\nAmbiance: Casual group dining that's ideal for friends, families and business gatherings.\nDecor: Contemporary decor in a villa setting (even has a pool in the back.)\nLocation: Centrally located in Thao Dien in District 2\nFavorite Dish: Ashima hotpot with Wagyu beef. Even the kids loved it. This is a huge for a parent! They also love the atomic ice cream (not shown here because they ate it before I can take a picture. Hahaha.)\nRead more\nWritten July 5, 2018",
