            "review_title": "Review at Ashima Mushroom Hotpot - Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "waget\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia376 contributions\n1\ngood mushroom variety\nJun 2018 • Family\nif you like mushrooms ... this is a good place to go to ... food is okay. service needs to be improved. while they do help you with the \"cooking\" some details need to be worked on - 1) it is always difficult to find a waiter. 2) they do not advice on the portions like they don't care if food is wasted if you over order. 3) they do not pay attention to bring kid order first - my daughter's food came last even if we ordered it first. 4) cleanliness is questionable. i saw them holding trash bags from upstairs while carrying our dessert with the other hand. 3 tables were finished eating but no one was even bothered to clear the tables. 5) guard saw us standing waiting for taxi and didn't care.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 28, 2018",
